  "limitations": [
    "Native modeled flight acceptance; saved-project promotion and hosted/browser flight proof remain separate gates.",
    "The existing body has bounded six-degree-of-freedom motion, authored inertia/drag/thrust constants and a simplified BMI270 feedback mapping.",
    "Fault acceptance proves latched output shutdown, passive rotor decay and model ground contact; it does not prove a controlled landing or impact survivability.",
    "The electrical plant is the declared ideal 24 V reduced-order STM32L476/BLDC model, without measured motor calibration, battery sag, transistor switching or native physical-board equivalence.",
    "The native motor checkpoint API does not provide full motor-state restore; no checkpoint round-trip claim is made."
  ],
  "integrationAppCommit": "3eb32947c2d591010682f8fc75734ba03c055dc9"
